{
 "id": "fox-aerial-confirm",
 "name": "Aerial hit confirm",
 "part": "punish",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "After a neutral air lands, shine the opponent that took it and grab the one that crouch cancelled it",
 "why": "The same neutral air does two different things. An opponent that takes it standing is in hitstun when Fox lands: the shine continues the combo. One that crouch cancels it is already shielding by then: the shine does nothing, and only a grab opens it. The half second between the hit and the landing is for seeing which.",
 "switch": "every",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Short hop next to the opponent, drift in, press A late in the hop and L before landing. Watch the hit: if the opponent flinches, down-B as Fox can act; if it stays crouched, Z.",
  "expect": "A try begins when the aerial hits and is judged when the shine or a grab lands, when Fox is hit or grabbed, or a second later. The opponent stands until Fox jumps: whether it crouch cancels shows only at the hit.",
  "example": [
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 10,
    "hold": 6
   },
   {
    "press": "A",
    "frame": 16,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 17,
    "hold": 13
   },
   {
    "press": "L",
    "frame": 28,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": "SF",
    "hold": 3
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": "SF",
    "hold": 2
   },
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": "GF",
    "hold": 1
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the neutral air hits. Watch what {opp} does",
   "19": "Frame {f}: Fox can act: the shine if it flinched, a grab if it stayed down"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "It took the hit",
    "text": [
     "Standing, {opp} flinches and slides back: hitstun. Fox lands, and on his first free frame, {18} frames after the hit, the shine reaches it before it can jump away.",
     "From the shine his combos start: this is the follow-up to choose when the hit was clean."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 10,
        "hold": 6
       },
       {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": 16,
        "hold": 1
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 17,
        "hold": 13
       },
       {
        "press": "L",
        "frame": 28,
        "hold": 1
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": "SF",
        "hold": 3
       },
       {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": "SF",
        "hold": 2
       },
       {
        "press": "Z",
        "frame": "GF",
        "hold": 1
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the neutral air hits. Watch what {opp} does",
       "19": "Frame {f}: Fox can act: the shine if it flinched, a grab if it stayed down"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         18
        ],
        "words": "Did it flinch, or stay crouched?",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         19,
         21
        ],
        "words": "Now: shine or grab",
        "kind": "go"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "It crouch cancelled",
    "text": [
     "Crouching at the hit, an opponent barely moves and is out of hitstun long before Fox lands. It shields: the shine would hit the shield and leave Fox open.",
     "A grab goes through the shield. Press Z instead of down-B when it stayed down."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 10,
        "hold": 6
       },
       {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": 16,
        "hold": 1
       },
       {
        "stick": [
